{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55010","headline":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 三十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 三十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城营角，吹声（辛本、川本、京本作「了」）远而微。\n韵断声长（京本作「哀」）人怪讶，兆当我衆有灾危，固守免倾（首本作「灾」，兹从辛本、川本、京本）颓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55010.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55010","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}